            "notes": "## **Round 1**\n\nRound 1 begins with choosing [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) as our power. [Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) will spawn an orb whenever you fade, so using it to place a damage orb on a Genji, Mei, Dva, Orisa, JQ, Rein, etc will wound them when they charge into you, but you can still follow up with fade and escape. \n\nYou can also use this to place healing orbs near teammates while running away or mid-fight, ensuring their lives are played safely. \n\nPick  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) ,  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) and   [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) for your staring perks.",
