            "notes": "## **Round 3**\n\n\nRound 3 begins with us choosing  [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) as our second power. Stacking this with [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) allows us to ensure that our orbs will put out as much healing and damage as possible this early on. If you can afford to keep  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and  [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) keep them; Fill with green perks starting with  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418).\n\nOptionally,  [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8) can be picked up at this point if you'd rather have it over  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and  [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) . Really depends on how the match is going.",
